dsh-chatdemo
============

This package implements a DSH provider whose request shape follows the public
client source of DeepSeek's chat-demo (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/chat-demo),
released under the MIT License.

The implementation in this repository is independently written: no source code
from chat-demo is copied. docs/SPEC.md records the observed request/response
contract and cites the upstream paths it comes from, for verification.

